   <narrative xml:lang="EN">[IPSTC] Strengthening Capacity for Peace and Security, Maritime and Disaster Risk Management in Kenya</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is based on the premise that reducing disaster risk is essential to achieve sustainable development and to eradicate poverty. By building the capacity of key actors and ensuring that development is risk-informed, countries and communities can be protected against losses and simultaneously boost economic growth, create jobs and livelihoods, strengthen access to health and education, and ensure that no one is left behind. This will have the double benefit of reducing the vulnerability</narrative>
  </description>
